&nbsp;","NAME OF COMPANY:

Abby Young Styling

MISSION STATEMENT

At Abby Young Styling, our mission is to cultivate lasting relationships with our clients—guiding them through life’s most significant moments and empowering them to express their authentic selves through personal style. We help seven-figure professionals elevate their self-image with purposefully curated wardrobes and collaborate with companies to craft modern, stylish brand identities. Our team is known for its efficiency, diligence, and exceptional attention to detail. We listen deeply, source the perfect pieces from both international brands and local partners, and consistently exceed expectations to bring each client’s unique vision to life.

POSITION: Marketing Assistant
JOB DESCRIPTION:

Abby Young Styling is seeking a Part-Time Marketing Assistant. This individual should be accustomed and eager to work in a fast-paced environment, and self-driven to lead research and project planning. The part-time position would be 90% remote, and 10% in-person in Mountain View, CA and approximately 10-20 hours per week. This position reports to and communicates closely with the CEO, Abby Young.

CORE DUTIES:

Manage social media content across all platforms (IG, TikTok, LI, Pinterest)
Create & plan content
Choose photos and publish to website
Manage & publish weekly blog posts on fashion news, trends, and styling tips
Create & plan content
Reference popular fashion keywords for SEO optimization
Publish blog posts across social media channels
Manage & publish monthly and seasonal newsletters
Create & plan content, graphic design, and copy
PR Management (publication relationship)
Pitch to local news publications
Respond to online news publications’ requests for stylists’ insight (via Qwoted, HARO)
Seek to build new visibility and publication relationships with brands
B2B Marketing materials graphic design & copy
Slide deck creation
Services advertisements
Sponsored content
Propose and organize collaborative events and service trades
Physical Marketing materials graphic design & copy
Promotional flyers, branding materials
Develop & improve copy across website, social media, newsletter, presentations, and email
Lead quarterly R&D presentations
Analyze and synthesize website/social media performance
Facilitate team-bonding
Propose business innovation and company-culture development
Conduct interviews and ghost-write fashion articles for a local arts & culture magazine
Digital lookbook creation

SPECIFIC JOB KNOWLEDGE, SKILLS, & ABILITIES

The Administrative Assistant must possess the following knowledge, skills and abilities and be able to explain and demonstrate that he or she can perform the essential functions of the job, with or without reasonable accommodation, using some other combination of skill and abilities:

Creativity with content creation
Initiative and a self-starter
Exceptional organizational skills
Diligent attention to detail
Flexibility with scheduling (during the weekends, approaching holidays, and with hours)
Open and honest communication
Dependability (we’re a team after all!)
Ability to problem solve before reaching out for help
Experience with customer service (e.g. retail, F&B, etc.)
Professionalism in the workplace and when client-facing
Ability to work in a fast-paced environment
Ability to meet specified deadlines
Some familiarity with entry-level spreadsheet functions
Career goals in fashion marketing
Experience with Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn, Pinterest, Slack, Canva, & Showit
Experience in content creation and writing

COMPENSATION: $22-27 per hour, depending on experience

OTHER BENEFITS INCLUDE:

Autonomy and on-the-job experience
Flexible hours and control over schedule
Commission incentive
Access to exclusive events and networking opportunities
Discounts from many clothing retailers

To Apply:

Please forward your resume and cover letter to admin@abbyyoungstyling.com

Next Steps After Applying:

After an initial interview with one of our team members, you may have the opportunity to be invited to a formal interview with Abby.

We look forward to meeting you!

