&nbsp;","We’re looking for a Founding GTM Systems Lead to join our team and build the connective tissue of our go-to-market engine. This is a high-leverage, builder-first role at the intersection of sales, marketing, and operations—designed for someone who thrives on untangling complexity and turning it into seamless automation and scale.

