&nbsp;","About Us

Dominick Consulting LLC is a growing, advisory-focused tax and consulting firm based in Auburn, WA. We help small business owners, real estate investors, and high-net-worth individuals achieve financial clarity through proactive tax strategies and personalized consulting.

We are seeking a reliable, organized, and proactive Executive Assistant & Operations Coordinator to support the business owner with scheduling, client management, billing, and daily operations. This position begins with in-office onboarding for the first few weeks before transitioning to a hybrid schedule that combines remote work with occasional in-person collaboration.

Why You’ll Love Working Here

