Responsibilities

Manage the owner’s calendar, calls, and inbox to ensure smooth communication and scheduling
Serve as the first point of contact for clients with professionalism and warmth
Set up new client accounts in Karbon (project management tool), assist with document collection, and maintain digital workflows
Create and send invoices, track payments, and follow up on outstanding balances
Maintain organized digital and physical files
Support firm operations through billing, scheduling, and administrative task management
Participate in in-office onboarding and training during the first few weeks
Assist in the Auburn office as needed for client prep or administrative projects

Qualifications

