&nbsp;","About Us

Titan Lighting is a home service company specializing in permanent holiday lighting systems, landscape lighting, and seasonal Christmas lighting. We pride ourselves on high customer satisfaction, quality installations, and excellent service. We are expanding our team and looking for a motivated remote appointment setter / tele-sales person to help turn leads into scheduled customers.

Position Summary

As a Remote Sales / Appointment Setter, you’ll make outbound calls (to warm leads or past inquiries) using a desk phone and a provided calling app, qualify prospects, and schedule appointments for our field sales or installation teams. You’ll be part time, with workload fluctuating based on lead volume.

You will not be fully remote cold-calling strangers en masse (unless you choose to), but rather follow up with inbound leads, previous inquiries, or marketing lists we provide.

Key Responsibilities

Use a desk phone and provided calling software/app to call prospective customers
Engage prospects in friendly, professional conversation; ask qualifying questions
Present Titan Lighting’s services (holiday lighting, landscape lighting, seasonal lighting) and capture interest
Schedule appointments / site visits for the field team
Log call notes, track results, update CRM or lead management system
Follow up (as needed) to confirm appointments or reengage prospects
Reach target metrics (calls/day, appointments set) when leads are available

Qualifications / Requirements

Excellent verbal communication skills and phone presence
Comfortable in a sales / outreach environment
Self-motivated, able to work independently
Basic computer / CRM skills, capable of using phone app, spreadsheet or lead tracking
Reliable internet connection (if working remotely)
Previous call center / tele-sales / appointment setting experience is a plus, but not strictly required
Ability to commit to certain hours per week (flexible but consistent)

Work Schedule & Hours

Part time; hours vary based on lead volume
We’ll estimate a weekly baseline (e.g. 10–20 hours during peak) but flexibility is expected
You’ll have windows of calls scheduled (e.g. weekday afternoons or evenings)
This is a remote role (home-based) using the phone app + desk phone

Compensation

Base + Appointment Bonus$14–$18/hr and $10–$25 per qualified appointment / site visit scheduled depending on job schedule, estimate scheduled and service scheduled.

Job Type: Part-time

Pay: $14.00 - $18.00 per hour

Expected hours: 15 – 30 per week

