Military

Ministry

Small Business Owners

Healthcare

College/Pro/Semi-Pro Athletes

Other Outside Sales

Bartenders & Servers


OUR IDEAL TEAM MEMBER


Growth-Oriented:

You're constantly looking for ways to improve yourself and you love to take on new challenges; you probably read a lot, and you're someone who seeks coaching.

Tenacious

: Obstacles energize you rather than deter you. You have the grit to push through and succeed. You like doing hard things that most people can't/won't do.

Competitive and Driven:

You're hungry to win, you go above & beyond what average people do, you're harder on yourself than anyone else is.

Disciplined and Independent

: You hold yourself accountable, set clear goals, and follow through consistently. You work well when no one is watching, and you thrive with a high level of responsibility.

Service-Minded

