&nbsp;","Close the Loop Renewed Solutions is a third-party refurbishment partner and reseller for high volumes of new, off-lease, or previously owned computers, inkjet, LaserJet, and commercial printers. Our extensive experience in designing and implementing go-to-market strategies for programs, products, and services, combined with our innovative approach to follow the best and highest use hierarchy is what sets us apart from anyone else.




As a globally preferred sustainability solutions provider, our team takes great pride in the relationships we have built with industry leading manufacturers; now with more than 30,000 devises refurbished each month, we are looking to add a Business-to-Business Sales Professional to help keep our promise of Zero Waste to Landfill through re-commerce!




Position Summary

As a New Business Development Professional at Close the Loop, you?ll be at the forefront of driving growth in the fast-moving world of re-commerce. From prospecting new opportunities to closing high-value deals, you?ll own the entire sales cycle and make an immediate impact. With your deep knowledge of ITAD channels, grading, resale values, and yield, you?ll build lasting partnerships and create real value for customers. Along the way, you?ll collaborate with our operations, refurbishment, and logistics teams to deliver seamless solutions?and grow a thriving book of business that?s all your own.




We Offer

