Build pricing using real-time resale data and margin targets, factoring condition grades, parts, and accessories
Manage the funnel in a CRM, maintain accurate forecasts, and report weekly pipeline health
Negotiate terms, close deals, and coordinate POs, invoicing, and delivery timelines with operations
Work closely with ITAD and refurb teams to match customer specs, confirm grades, and reserve stock
Track printer opportunities including supplies and service attachments for HP inkjet, LaserJet, and commercial models
Maintain vendor and channel relationships and stay current on OEM programs and restrictions
