Working knowledge of ITAD processes intake, triage, grading A B C BER, data wipe, and parts harvesting
Strong grasp of secondary market pricing and drivers? condition, spec, GPU, display, battery, page count, accessories
Familiarity with HP, Lenovo, Dell, Apple laptop lines and HP printer family?s, inkjet, LaserJet, DesignJet, PageWide, and enterprise
CRM proficiency HubSpot, Salesforce or similar plus Excel or Sheets for quoting and margin modeling
Clear written and verbal communication and comfort negotiating with procurement and C-level buyers
Self-starter mindset with consistent prospecting habits and follow-through



Nice to Have

Existing book of SMB, EDU, public sector, or reseller accounts
Experience selling refurbished hardware or working at an ITAD, VAR, or broker
Knowledge of shipping logistics, export compliance, and warranties for refurbished goods



