About Peak Performance Physical Therapy: Peak Performance Physical Therapy is dedicated to providing exceptional care and innovative treatment to our patients. Our mission is to improve the human connection through health and wellness. We are currently seeking a highly organized and detail-oriented Executive Assistant to support our CEO/Founder in managing the day-to-day operations and strategic initiatives of the company.

