6+ years experience in an administrative role providing support to senior executives.
Experience with G Suite products and applications, including Gmail, calendar, drive and Google Slides.
Demonstrated ability to manage and meet deadlines in a fast-paced environment.
Excellent prioritization and time management skills.
Ability to organize and coordinate multiple concurrent projects.
Ability to identify and solve problems in a creative way.
Collaboratively work with all levels of management and staff.
Flexible team player, willing to adapt to changes and tackle challenges directly.
Excellent written and oral communication skills.
