As an Account Specialist, you will provide outstanding customer service to your assigned accounts, maintain information in Salesforce, schedule a variety of photographic events and develop relationships with a variety of people both within and outside of Lifetouch. If you thrive in a fast-paced environment, love helping people, are highly organized and able to handle multiple priorities, you will be successful in this role.

Our Account Specialist role is a full-time position eligible for medical, dental, and life insurance benefits, 401K, and holiday pay.

