Springfield is in the heart of Lane County, located in the southern Willamette Valley. Within one hour of our office, there is access to the Oregon coast, the Cascade Mountain Range, and numerous National Forests. We have been a strong engineering presence in this area for over 45 years. Our culture is professional yet casual, and family-oriented.

At Branch Engineering, we strive to provide the highest quality engineering and surveying services to our clients at a reasonable price while maintaining an enjoyable and comfortable workplace environment where our staff has the opportunity to learn, grow, and prosper. We prioritize a healthy life/work balance.

