Our workload is consistent and well balanced with public and private work. Some of the more pertinent work we have is for our municipal clients that include active and anticipated projects from local cities, utility boards, and parks and recreation districts. Representative project types include existing building alterations or repairs, new building design and engineering, various residential structures, small non-building commercial structures, parks structures and buildings, and PEMB foundation design.

