About Silex Data Solutions
Silex Data Solutions helps customers modernize, secure, and scale their data environments through technology solutions and trusted partnerships.

Role Overview

Role Overview: As a Business Development Representative (BDR) at Silex Data Solutions, you will build pipeline and accelerate revenue by identifying, engaging, and qualifying prospective customers. You will collaborate closely with sales, marketing, and partner teams to launch campaigns, secure introductory meetings, and hand off qualified opportunities. You’ll leverage modern sales tools, maintain meticulous data hygiene, and continuously sharpen product and industry knowledge to deliver a high-quality first impression with prospects.

Key Responsibilities

Prospect daily via outbound email, social, and phone to generate first meetings with target accounts and personas.
Qualify inbound leads and outbound prospects against ICP criteria; capture discovery notes and next steps.
Schedule and coordinate meetings across multiple calendars and time zones; prepare agendas, materials, and follow-ups.
Maintain accurate records in CRM and spreadsheets (pipelines, KPIs, action registers) with timely updates.
Collaborate with partner teams on co-marketing and enablement activities to drive awareness and first meetings.
Support event planning and execution (webinars, lunch-and-learns, user groups) to engage target audiences.
Complete vendor sales trainings and certifications to improve product fluency and credibility in conversations.
Prepare basic quotes or information requests and coordinate smooth handoffs to account executives for advanced scoping.
Contribute ideas and experiments to improve outreach performance, messaging, and conversion rates.

