&nbsp;","Outside Sales Consultant - Educational Photographic Workshop Experiences
Are you a powerful sales consultant? We are seeking ambitious, intelligent and experienced sales consultants to join our world class team. The ENTJ personality Type or similar is an ideal Candidate for this position. This is an opportunity to work remotely and make substantial income selling educational experiences. Make sure to complete the phone screening to be considered for this position. Our current top sales reps have made $20,000 in their first month!!

Our Company is the Most Elite Educational Photographic & Video Production Workshop Series in the World. We Direct Extremely High End 5 Star Photographic Experiences to clients that range from $21,500 to $35,000 per experience and we have a 95% Re-Enrollment Rate!!! We have Directed 150 Elite Photographic Workshops over the last 16 Years and are owned and Directed by a TV Host, Director and Celebrity Fashion Photographer.

Earn up to $150k, and we give you the Premium Leads! Have you always been a top performer? Do you want to work from home? Are you driven to succeed? Bring your ambition to our Luxury Photographic Experiences Company as a Consultant where you will speak to Photographers about their Goals, Discover why they haven't achieved their goals, and then Enroll them in Elite Photographic Workshops in which they will photograph the greatest images of their careers! We provide the LEADS, YOU close the DEALS! Our top performers are on track to make $150k annually, average performers make $100k!

REQUIREMENTS for the Position

Responsibilities:

Close Deals and earn extremely generous commissions. $$$
Make Calls using SalesForce Dialer to speak to Photographers
Setup Zoom Calls with Clients and Enroll them on One-Call Closes
Meet and exceed assigned sales quota
Prioritize and target customers and prospects by the potential for revenues/profits, cost to sell and service, and the probability of success
Be an expert in all of our Elite Photographic Experiences & Services. Continually upgrade product knowledge and acquire enhanced selling skills
Incorporate Grant Cardone Closing Strategies and Learned through out Elite Sales Training Program to
Stay aware of the competition, and Make Sure our Clients Understand How Much Higher Quality our Elite Photographic Experiences are above all others in the World
Work collaboratively with other employees in sales, marketing, and customer service departments
Performs other related duties as assigned by management.

Qualifications:

4 Year College Education
Computer skills required: Basic SalesForce Knowledge
Proven track record of sales success
Ability to thrive in a short sales cycle
Drive to make 100+ calls per day
Setup at least 3 Zoom calls per day
Brand Ambassador mentality
Self-starter
Strong listening and presentation skills
Impeccable customer service skills - empathy & integrity are a must!

You will get the support, camaraderie, and compensation you desire with world class training and flexibility to do what it takes to build relationships and close deals. Our value proposition is second-to-none, as our Elite Photographic Workshops are Literally the Ferrari of the Photographic Workshop Industry. You will need to be at the top of your game to be successful. It is important that you are ready for a challenge and excited to get out there and help each client, make deals and close business. Not willing to. Cannot wait to!

You will be the the first point of contact to enroll customers into our exclusive high-end experiences around the world. You will be speaking with current and future clients to help them hit their bucket list of dream destinations they have always wanted to discover and photograph. You will be our brand ambassadors, supporting our mission to accelerate the growth of our customer's dream job.

You will primarily be selling our high intensive $21,500 elite 5 day fashion, lifestyle, swim & beauty photography workshops that we have been directing and selling successfully for 13 years in Los Angeles, Newport Beach, New York, Chicago, Dallas, Denver, San Diego, Las Vegas, Washington DC, Atlanta, Newport Beach and Miami Beach and $35,000 Photographic Workshop Experiences at our 49 Room Palace in France owned by our CEO & Director.

In addition to our high end American Photographic Workshops, we also offer $21,500 to $35,000 Elite Fashion Travel Photographic Experience to a 49 Room, 13th Century 40,000 Square Foot Castle in France!!! The prospective students will have the opportunity to photograph and film from an aerial drone with Super Models from Paris and Milan and have a 6 day Ultra Luxury Stay at the Castle owned by our Director Kevin Michael along with a Michelin Star Chef and Masseuse on Premise!!

You will be selling to emerging & professional photographers and hobbyists who want to see the world and photograph beautiful pictures with super models. Most of our clients have a very high net worth, so you must be polished, articulate and professional.

Ability to close a $21,500 to $35,000 sale in a single interaction. You will be trained to close your ideal prospects on the first Zoom Call with a 30% closing ratio (our best sales professionals achieve 60% closing ratios on Zoom Calls). We provide you with the best qualified leads, call scripts, and exceptional product and sales training to make you an even better sales person and closer than perhaps even you thought you could be.

The Luxury Photographic Workshop Experiences sell themselves as our clients are raving fans: OUR COMPANY HAS A 95% RE-ENROLLMENT RATE!!! Our current customers enroll in anywhere from 2 to 11 of these $21,500 photographic experiences because they have such an incredible experience and buy time after time. Your job is to cultivate relationships with these customers and register them in upcoming photographic experiences.

You must be a transactional salesperson – in other words, a CLOSER. You must enjoy the close and be extremely effective at it.

Call targeted leads to engage customers personally with the goal of getting them to attend one of our workshops. Overcome any put-offs, isolate to the true objection, and then overcome that objection to make the sale.

Understand who the customer is, why they are interested in taking the career to the next level and their intent and timeline to purchase.

Educate and excite guests by answering their questions and providing a tailored experience based on their interests and agenda.

Create a detailed Customer Profile for every lead in SalesForce. Update all details and interactions with the customers in Salesforce and call using a SalesForce Dialer as well as using Zoom to personally connect with customers face to face virtually.

Maintain a healthy sales pipeline for ongoing follow-up with individuals who exhibit purchase intent and potential to be hot customers who want to purchase multiple products.

